<title>USA: Santa Fe Energy names Clark as CFO, VP.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Energy names Clark as CFO, VP.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe Energy Resources said it named Janet Clark as vice president and chief financial officer, replacing Graham Whaling.</p>
<p>Whaling has been named to the new position of chairman and chief executive officer at Monterey Resources Inc, which went public in November.</p>
<p>Santa Fe holds an 83 percent stake in Monterey.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk, 212/859-1700))</p>
